flowchart TD
  START[Open OOS-RECON-001 from assigned PEMS task] --> SCOPE[Resolve permitted sellers and task-run links]
  SCOPE --> SNAP[System snapshots RetailOps unavailable ASINs + timestamps]
  SNAP --> UP[Upload BrandCentral report; Vendor report or approved N/A]
  UP --> VALID{Valid source inputs, freshness and coverage?}
  VALID -->|No| FIX[Correct/reupload or record reviewed exception]
  FIX --> VALID
  VALID -->|Yes| REC[Reconcile 3 source union per seller/channel/ASIN]
  REC --> PAR[Compute full-catalog seller GMS Pareto and assign affected tiers]
  PAR --> DEC{Classification}
  DEC -->|Confirmed OOS| INC[Durable replenishment incident]
  DEC -->|Unknown or missing| MAN[Manual evidence investigation]
  DEC -->|Positive stock reports but unavailable marketplace| SYNCQ[Authorize targeted marketplace resync]
  SYNCQ --> EXEC[Execute actual rate-gated sync job]
  EXEC --> VERIFY{Server obtains newer trusted post-sync observation}
  VERIFY -->|In stock| RES[Resolved with evidence and audit]
  VERIFY -->|Still unavailable or failed| INC
  MAN --> INC
  INC --> FOLLOW[Owner + seller communication + ETA + next follow-up]
  FOLLOW --> EXPORT[Export 01 Active OOS; 02 Discrepancies; 03 Resync Resolved; 04 Summary & Sources]
  RES --> EXPORT
  EXPORT --> GATE{Server checks every task-bound run and required evidence}
  GATE -->|Missing| FOLLOW
  GATE -->|Pass| SUB[Executor submits to PEMS Review Queue]
  SUB --> DECIDE{Independent reviewer}
  DECIDE -->|Reject| FIX
  DECIDE -->|Approve| CLOSE[Close daily task, not persistent unresolved incidents]
